### 5.4 内部模块

| 模块 | 职责 |
|---|---|
| CLI Session Manager | 启动、登录、心跳、重连、prompt 识别 |
| Command Planner | 根据知识库和测试意图生成 CLI 命令序列 |
| Command Executor | 执行命令，处理分页、超时、确认提示、错误码 |
| Output Parser | 将 CLI 文本输出解析成结构化 JSON |
| State Snapshotter | 配置前后 dump 状态，用于比对和回滚 |
| Rollback Generator | 自动生成回滚命令 |
| CLI Failure Classifier | 区分命令错误、SDK bug、DUT 异常、环境异常 |

### 5.5 工具服务接口

```yaml
service: sdk_cli_tool_service
apis:
  - open_session(target_env, connection_profile, sdk_branch) -> session_id, prompt, sdk_version
  - run_command(session_id, command, timeout_sec) -> stdout, stderr, exit_status, parsed_error
  - run_command_batch(session_id, commands, stop_on_error) -> batch_result
  - snapshot_state(session_id, snapshot_profile) -> snapshot_id, snapshot_json_path
  - diff_snapshot(before_snapshot_id, after_snapshot_id) -> state_diff
  - query_counter(session_id, counter_spec) -> counter_values
  - generate_rollback(state_diff) -> rollback_commands
  - close_session(session_id) -> close_status
```

