## 6. 双 Agent 协作协议

Traffic Agent 与 SDK CLI Agent 之间必须通过结构化事件交互，不能依赖自然语言聊天式同步。

### 6.1 共享状态对象

```json
{
  "test_id": "TP-PFC-GEN3-0001",
  "phase": "configuring | ready_to_traffic | traffic_running | observing | diagnosing | completed",
  "chip_version": "Switch_Gen3",
  "target_env": "fpga_ixia",
  "topology": {
    "ingress_port": "port1",
    "egress_port": "port2",
    "queue": 3
  },
  "config_state": {
    "port_ready": true,
    "qos_ready": true,
    "pfc_ready": true,
    "telemetry_ready": false
  },
  "traffic_state": {
    "flow_compiled": true,
    "traffic_running": false,
    "last_run_id": null
  },
  "observations": {
    "cli_counters": {},
    "traffic_stats": {},
    "logs": []
  },
  "locks": {
    "lab_resource": "fpga_board_03",
    "ixia_ports": ["1/1", "1/2"]
  }
}
```

### 6.2 事件类型

| 事件 | 发送方 | 接收方 | 含义 |
|---|---|---|---|
| `CONFIG_READY` | SDK CLI Agent | Traffic Agent | 芯片配置完成，可以打流 |
| `CONFIG_FAILED` | SDK CLI Agent | Planner / Reflection / Traffic | 配置失败，停止打流 |
| `TRAFFIC_READY` | Traffic Agent | SDK CLI Agent | 流量脚本已生成，可以预检查 |
| `TRAFFIC_STARTED` | Traffic Agent | SDK CLI Agent | 流量已开始，CLI 侧开始采样 counters |
| `TRAFFIC_STOPPED` | Traffic Agent | SDK CLI Agent | 流量已停止，CLI 侧做最终 dump |
| `COUNTER_ANOMALY` | SDK CLI Agent | Traffic / Reflection | counters 异常，需要关联流量统计 |
| `TRAFFIC_ANOMALY` | Traffic Agent | SDK CLI / Reflection | 丢包/乱序/延迟异常，需要查芯片状态 |
| `ROLLBACK_DONE` | SDK CLI Agent | Planner / Executor | 环境已恢复 |

### 6.3 协同流程

```text
1. Planner 输出测试计划
2. Search 输出 Evidence Bundle
3. SDK CLI Agent 生成配置计划
4. Traffic Agent 生成流量计划
5. Critic 同时审查配置计划与流量计划
6. SDK CLI Agent snapshot before
7. SDK CLI Agent 执行配置
8. SDK CLI Agent 发 CONFIG_READY
9. Traffic Agent start traffic
10. SDK CLI Agent 周期性 query counters
11. Traffic Agent 收集 tx/rx/pcap/latency
12. Traffic Agent stop traffic
13. SDK CLI Agent snapshot after + final counters
14. 二者联合生成 pass/fail verdict
15. 失败进入 Reflection；成功进入 coverage update
16. SDK CLI Agent 执行 rollback 或恢复默认状态
```

